Joining me today is Dr. Lynn Buffka, senior director of practice research and policy here at APA, the American Psychological Association. Dr. Buffka is also a practicing psychologist and has been talking constantly to, journalists who are covering the coronavirus pandemic. Normally, Lynn and I would be in the APA recording studio together, but because of the virus, we are teleworking and sheltering in place. So, Lynn, welcome to speaking of psychology. Thank you for inviting me. So for the last couple of weeks,

5
